"Addresses, websites, birthdays and photo, editable with iCloud; import and "
"export of vCard files."

#: src/WhatsNew.vala:28
msgid "AirPods et recopie"
msgstr "AirPods and mirroring"

#: src/WhatsNew.vala:29
msgid ""
"Alerte de batterie faible, pause quand vous retirez un écouteur, captures "
"d'écran de la recopie dans le dossier Images."
msgstr ""
"Low battery alert, pause when you take out an earbud, mirroring screenshots "
"in the Pictures folder."

#: src/WhatsNew.vala:31
msgid "Plus de notifications fantômes"
msgstr "No more ghost notifications"

#: src/WhatsNew.vala:32
msgid ""
"Une notification effacée sur l'iPhone disparaît aussi de ce PC, même si elle "
"a été effacée pendant une coupure, et une notification fermée ici ne revient "
"plus."
msgstr ""
"A notification cleared on the iPhone also leaves this PC, even when it was "
"cleared while the link was down, and a notification closed here no longer "
"comes back."

#: src/WhatsNew.vala:34
msgid "Une réparation guidée"
msgstr "A guided repair"

#: src/WhatsNew.vala:35
msgid ""
"Quand les notifications s'arrêtent, « Appairer à nouveau » efface les "
"anciennes clés et vous guide pas à pas pour refaire un appairage propre."
msgstr ""
"When notifications stop, “Pair again” clears the old keys and guides you "
"step by step through a clean pairing."

#: src/WhatsNew.vala:37
msgid "Notifications qui tiennent"
msgstr "Notifications that last"

#: src/WhatsNew.vala:38
msgid ""
"Les notifications de l'iPhone reviennent seules après une reconnexion ou un "
"redémarrage : plus besoin d'appairer à nouveau."
msgstr ""
"iPhone notifications come back on their own after a reconnection or a "
"restart: no need to pair again."

#: src/WhatsNew.vala:40
msgid "L'iPhone en haut de la fenêtre"
msgstr "The iPhone at the top of the window"

#: src/WhatsNew.vala:41
msgid ""
"Son nom, sa batterie et un arc en trois parties qui se remplit à mesure que "
"la liaison s'établit. Un clic explique ce qui se passe et propose quoi faire."
msgstr ""
"Its name, its battery and a three-part arc that fills as the link comes up. "
"A click explains what is happening and suggests what to do."

#: src/WhatsNew.vala:43
msgid "Reconnexion plus rapide"
msgstr "Faster reconnection"

#: src/WhatsNew.vala:44
msgid ""
"Dès qu'un appareil Apple est capté à proximité, Boomerang tente de "
"reconnecter l'iPhone sans attendre son prochain essai. Le service redémarre "
"seul s'il se fige."
msgstr ""
"As soon as an Apple device is picked up nearby, Boomerang tries to reconnect "
"the iPhone without waiting for its next attempt. The service restarts on its "
"own if it freezes."

#: src/WhatsNew.vala:46
msgid "Modules à la demande"
msgstr "Modules on demand"

#: src/WhatsNew.vala:47
msgid ""
"Messages, appels, contacts, notifications et lecture en cours restent "
"toujours là. AirPods, iCloud, fichiers, recopie et le reste s'ajoutent "
"depuis « Ajouter des modules… ». Ce que vous utilisiez déjà reste ajouté."
msgstr ""
"Messages, calls, contacts, notifications and Now Playing are always there. "
"AirPods, iCloud, files, mirroring and the rest are added from “Add "
"Modules…”. What you already used stays added."

#: src/WhatsNew.vala:50
msgid "Une colonne plus courte"
msgstr "A shorter sidebar"

#: src/WhatsNew.vala:51
msgid ""
"Réglages, guide, contributeurs et À propos passent dans le menu de la barre "
"d'en-tête."
msgstr "Settings, guide, contributors and About move to the header bar menu."

#: src/WhatsNew.vala:52
